        "original_id": "fc31e326-efb2-59a5-a225-6ee3660e91f0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alan Faena, Ximena Caminos\n- Organizations: Faena Group, Faena Art\n- Places: Faena Arts Center, Faena District Buenos Aires, Puerto Madero, Buenos Aires\n- Projects: Via Vai\n- Roles: fashion designer, Chair, Executive Creative Director, partner, Chief Curator, Executive Director\n\nFacts:\n- Ximena Caminos has served since 2004 as Chief Curator and Executive Director of the Faena Arts Center in Buenos Aires.\n- Ximena Caminos is Chair of Faena Art, Executive Creative Director, and a partner in Faena Group.\n- Alan Faena founded Via Vai, a fashion label, in 1985 and previously worked as a fashion designer.\n- The Faena Arts Center is the cultural center of Faena District Buenos Aires, a residential and cultural community in the Puerto Madero waterfront in Buenos Aires.\n- Faena Group developed Faena District Buenos Aires and opened it in September 2011.\n- Alan Faena founded the Faena Arts Center.",
